{"expires":1779742140597,"value":{"code":200,"headers":{"etag":"W/\"w8Qu4S4Hap\"","last-modified":"Mon, 25 May 2026 19:49:00 GMT","cache-control":"max-age=3600"},"body":{"title":"Getting Started","slug":"getting-started","tags":["quickstart","setup","nuxt"],"content":"# Getting Started\n\nWelcome to **DevDocs** — the modern documentation platform built for developers who care about quality and speed.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore you begin, ensure you have the following installed:\n\n- **Node.js** 18.x or later\n- **npm** 9.x, **pnpm** 8.x, or **yarn** 1.x\n- A code editor (we recommend VS Code)\n\n## Quick Install\n\nThe fastest way to get started is with our CLI tool:\n\n```bash\nnpx create-my-app my-project\ncd my-project\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nYour development server will start at `http://localhost:3000`.\n\n## Manual Setup\n\n### 1. Create a new project\n\n```bash\nmkdir my-project && cd my-project\nnpm init -y\n```\n\n### 2. Install dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install nuxt @nuxt/ui @nuxt/content\n```\n\n### 3. Create your config file\n\nCreate a `nuxt.config.ts` at the root of your project:\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: ['@nuxt/ui', '@nuxt/content'],\n})\n```\n\n### 4. Start the server\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-project/\n├── assets/\n│   └── css/\n│       └── main.css\n├── components/\n├── content/\n│   └── docs/\n├── layouts/\n│   └── default.vue\n├── pages/\n│   ├── index.vue\n│   └── docs/\n│       └── [...slug].vue\n├── nuxt.config.ts\n└── package.json\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Installation](/docs/installation) — detailed setup for different environments\n- [Configuration](/docs/configuration) — all available config options\n- [Architecture](/docs/architecture) — understand how the system works\n","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"getting-started"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Getting Started"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Welcome to "},{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"DevDocs"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — the modern documentation platform built for developers who care about quality and speed."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"prerequisites"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisites"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before you begin, ensure you have the following installed:"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Node.js"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 18.x or later"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"npm"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 9.x, "},{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pnpm"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 8.x, or "},{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"yarn"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 1.x"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A code editor (we recommend VS Code)"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"quick-install"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Install"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The fastest way to get started is with our CLI tool:"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-bash","code":"npx create-my-app my-project\ncd my-project\nnpm run dev\n","language":"bash","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"npx create-my-app my-project\ncd my-project\nnpm run dev\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your development server will st